tmp
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

node_modules
dist
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Reviews and review responses. Working artifacts rather than project source: they
# describe a moment, they are written by more than one agent at once, and a
# half-finished one is noise in the history of a repository whose value is in its
# code and specifications.
review

# The mutation gate's lock. Present only while a run is in flight; if one is committed it
# is a run that was killed hard enough to miss its own cleanup.
.check-silent.lock

# Session handover notes. Scratch, not source: it describes one conversation and
# goes stale the moment work continues. Add it to .prettierignore too, or
# `npm run verify` fails on a file nothing builds.
context.md

# Local logs
*.log
